// VBRA_lineage_merge.schema — branch A appends `from_a`
//
// THE BRANCH CASE (docs/FIXED-FORM-BILL-READS-BACKWARD.md §8a.1): a hotfix
// appends one field while main appends another, each passing its own baseline.
// After the merge the reader must read BOTH pre-merge writers' files, by the
// name-subset rule and not by position.

package vbra_lineage_merge

fixed table Merged
{
    anchor   int32 = 1
    from_a int32 = 10
}
